<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hello, <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hello...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, sorry, it took me a while to pick up..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Morning sickness?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... it had me knocked out for a bit..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's wrong?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I went for my regular checkup just now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, that's right, that was today, wasn't it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"And, well... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
Thank you for calling me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I haven't explained anything yet..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But I understood, so that's enough, isn't it?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uuu... Uugh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Akane<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, that's all it was... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When you're having a hard time with morning sickness, too, sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll hang up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"W-wait, <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>!"
{PLAYSND "SE\電話切れる.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> told me too. That it was a shame, what happened with the Niimuras."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>'s still young, so a second one―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s body can't do it anymore, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's painful, but isn't this sort of thing all part of what they call life?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I know, but why does it have to be <STYLE ID="1">her</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
She never had any family all this time, she wanted a family more than anyone, so why her, of all people..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The least we can do is treat her the same as always, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>, do you really think that?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I can't see <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> with my belly this big. 
{PAUSE ""}
Let alone after I've given birth."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It can't be helped right now, but we have to think about something even a little positive."</STYLE><PG>
"Is there some good way, then? A way for <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> to have a child."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"For that, there's nothing left but to adopt, is there... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But whether </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would even want that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Adoption...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Did you say something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, nothing. 
{PAUSE ""}
Sorry, <STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>, I'm going to lie down for a bit."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sure. </STYLE>You<STYLE ID="2"> take care of yourself too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"Adoption, huh..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hello, Mom?
{PAUSE ""}
　Yeah, it's still pretty rough after all. 
{PAUSE ""}
I told you about <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> earlier, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　About that, I'd like to hear what you think too, Mom..."<PG>
"I see... You can't say yes or no to it, huh. 
{PAUSE ""}
I guess not... 
{PAUSE ""}
Okay, I'll talk the rest over with <STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>. Thanks."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
I really do want to help <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I'm sorry, I never asked what you think, and you're the one who matters most. 
{PAUSE ""}
How could you be the happiest, I wonder... 
{PAUSE ""}
Would you rather be a child of this house after all?
{PAUSE ""}
　Or..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, <STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Listen, <STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>, there's something about <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> I want to talk over with you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">All right, let's hear it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Look, I just want you to hear it as one idea. 
{PAUSE ""}
If it's a no, just say no."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What do you think about giving this child up for adoption?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So that's what you were thinking after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">When I brought up the word 'adoption' earlier, your face changed a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Honestly, I can't agree to it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I figured..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"But when I think about how </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> will get along from here on... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">it's a tough one..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
Thanks. Just knowing you hesitated even a little makes me happy."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I know that for </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> means a great deal. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="2"> can't let go of adoption as an option? If so, then it's something we should take time to think about."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">That girl</STYLE> is never rewarded for anything, really. 
{PAUSE ""}
Even though she's purer and more honest than anyone. 
{PAUSE ""}
I want <STYLE ID="1">her</STYLE> to be happy, no matter what."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can be happy, can </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2"> be happy too?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If giving the baby up for adoption leads to </STYLE>your<STYLE ID="2"> happiness, I'll think about it more too."</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>, thank you. 
{PAUSE ""}
But I want to think it over without rushing. Give me a little more time."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Got it. I'll think it through carefully too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">: the question isn't whether we feel </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ふびん">sorry</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> for her, it's whether </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2"> can be happy. We look at it from that angle. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If this cuts things off with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2"> end up dragging it around forever, that's not the right decision."</STYLE><PG>
"Yeah... 
{PAUSE ""}
But I think my feelings are running high right now and my judgment's dulled. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm going to sleep a bit again."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sure. Call me if anything happens."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"Because... 
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
I promised I'd help her no matter what... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>... I really do want to help you..."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
